The design now avoids the usual planted-signature bug: every candidate component in a lane is sampled from the same uniform affine-permutation distribution, and all are valid witnesses. The search space is enlarged by the field size while the answer remains twelve integers; the paper-specific certificate is a P4-factor obtained by composing perfect matchings along the three super-edges.
