+NOTES = r"""
+Definition and native construction. Section 1 defines a T-factor as vertex-
+disjoint, not necessarily induced copies of a fixed tree covering every graph
+vertex. Section 3 (the paragraph around equations in lines 215--219 of the
+arXiv v2 HTML, in the proof of Theorem 1) constructs a T-factor in a regular
+blow-up by choosing one perfect matching on every super-edge of T. This module
+uses exactly that native P4 blow-up object. Each affine map x -> ax+b with
+a != 0 is a perfect matching, and its three copies along P4 compose to q
+vertex-disjoint P4s in its lane. Lanes are disjoint and together cover all
+4*lanes*q vertices.
+
+Step-0 discrimination and track. The paper proves existence and approximate
+packing, not distributional computational hardness. Its proof route invokes
+perfect matchings (Lemma 3.4 in Section 3 and Lemma 4.1 in Section 4), so a
+Track-A claim would be false: matching is algorithmic, and this promised
+affine subfamily has an even simpler exhaustive algorithm. This is therefore
+Track B. At shipping size, selftest measures the reference algorithm's exact
+edge probes and wall time. The compact route pairs the three possible images
+of coordinates 0 and 1 and checks coordinate 2. make_instance symmetrically
+conditions the sampled affine components so that only the three true pairings
+survive that check. With six lanes this costs at most 6*3^2*5 = 270 small exact
+operations, while coefficient scanning is far beyond unaided hand execution.
+
+Generation and answer count. Every one of the three affine components in a
+lane is sampled from the same distribution and every one is a valid answer;
+there is no distinguished planted-vs-decoy statistic. Distinct affine maps
+can agree at at most one field coordinate. More generally, if an affine map F
+is contained row-by-row in the union of d distinct affine maps F_j, then
+product_j(F-F_j) has q roots and degree at most d<q, hence is the zero
+polynomial; because F_q[x] is an integral domain, F=F_j for some j. Thus there
+are exactly degree**lanes answers. The stored witness is sampled before the
+neighbor tables are built and is never recovered from them.
+
+Easy regimes and attacks. T=K2 is just ordinary perfect matching, and Section
+5 notes that below log(n)/n isolated vertices obstruct even one factor. For
+this promised family small q is hand-scale; large q grows the coefficient
+haystack without lengthening the answer. The panel tests degree outliers,
+lexicographic greedy pairing, 256 random restarts, and the obvious translation
+ansatz. All component maps are regular permutations, their public order is
+erased, and none of those probes correlates all six lanes. Exhaustive affine
+scanning intentionally succeeds and is reported separately, as Track B
+requires.
+""".strip()
