+NOTES = """\
+Section 1 fixes the exact factor definition: copies need not be induced, must be
+vertex-disjoint, and together cover every vertex. Section 3 defines a blow-up of
+a fixed tree and the proof of Theorem 1 (especially the paragraph following
+Lemma 3.4) says that arbitrary perfect matchings on its super-edges combine into
+a T-factor. This module specializes the native object to T=P3 and asks for the
