The redesigned family now verifies at every preset. At `hard`, it renders an 88k-character native graph, has 33,784,128 structurally valid matrix candidates, a 31-character/9-element answer, and a 286-operation invariant route. The reference enumerator needs 112,650 counted field operations on the audit seed, while all four quick probes fail there. I’m running the complete 200k-sample and eight-seed gate suite now.
