+"""Verified affine P3-factor-packing generator for arXiv:1304.2429.
 
-The paper observes that perfect matchings on the two super-edges of a blow-up
-of the three-vertex path combine into a P3-factor.  This module constructs the
-two matchings as affine bijections over F_q^3 and carries their coefficient
-matrices as a compact, exact certificate.
+Section 3 of the paper forms a T-factor by taking one perfect matching on
+every super-edge of a blow-up of T. Here T=P3. Each of the two super-edges
+is constructed as a union of affine perfect matchings over F_q^3, with a
+common linear part. A single 3x3 matrix therefore certifies a complete
+edge-decomposition into P3-factors.
 """
 
 from __future__ import annotations
@@ -22,9 +23,9 @@
 
