codex
Implemented a deterministic Track B generator using the paper’s native `P3` blow-up and perfect-matching composition from Section 3 of the [full paper](https://arxiv.org/html/1304.2429v2).

Local verification passes every gate:

- Exact density: 1 valid certificate in 11,587,955,904.
- Random guessing: 0/200,000.
- Four adversarial attacks: all 0/8.
