index 002162d2aa966f715d7599a3cf973a738638cb95..90b2d494bd316d225951c2b2f87ca4cb1adf7261
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -1,227 +1,111 @@
-# Affine certificates for packed P3-factors
-
-> Status: **all local gates pass; external hardening is blocked**. The required
-> OpenRouter runs reached the service but every redraw received account-level
-> HTTP 403 “total key limit exceeded.” Those are errors, not solver failures, so
-> this directory does not yet contain evidence for an oracle-hardness claim.
+# Affine packing of tree factors — arXiv:1304.2429
 
-| profile field | value |
+| Profile field | Value |
 |---|---|
-| track | B — no-tool compression |
-| native domain | combinatorics |
-| object regime | finite field |
-| computational core | linear algebra |
-| certificate form | matrix certificate |
-| native objects | a three-partite `P3` blow-up, two regular super-edges, and an edge-disjoint `P3`-factor packing |
